    <p class="single_template-short-summary">
      <strong>Proposal professionals are using AI—especially ChatGPT—to save time, improve quality, and reduce the manual burden of writing proposals. From summarizing massive documents to generating staff bios and risk plans, AI helps teams move faster and write better.</strong>
    </p>

    <p class="single_template-long-summary">
